# What EAS Build does NOT need to compile the app.
#
# Without this the upload was 112 MB, of which ~56 MB was docs/ — spike
# illustration sheets and Boa's sample Volume, several megabytes per PNG.
# None of it is imported by the app; it was being shipped to a build server
# to be thrown away, and on a slow connection it made the upload the longest
# part of the build.
#
# .easignore replaces .gitignore for the build archive, so the usual
# gitignored paths have to be repeated here.

# --- repository history: 72 MB, and the build server has no use for it ---
# This is what kept the archive at 56.9 MB even after docs/ was excluded.
# EAS reads the commit metadata before archiving, so excluding it here costs
# nothing but the upload.
.git/

# --- normal build output, as .gitignore ---
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
coverage/
*.log

# --- docs and research: the bulk of it ---
docs/

# --- tests and tooling that never run on the build server ---
e2e/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright/
maestro/
.maestro/

# --- backend, deployed separately via the Supabase CLI ---
supabase/

# --- local editor and OS noise ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/

# --- secrets: never in a build archive ---
.env.e2e
